      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "The Gedlec team run as a well oiled and professional team. From the point of the first call, through to commissioning of the installed system, Gerard and his team were fantastic.Our house in Kew (Melbourne) has always been very probelmatic for solar panel installations - steep pitched roof with small terracotta shingles. I have been through more than ten installers to try and get quotes for a solar panel installation - virtually all turn the job down as too complicated or too risky.Gedlec saw the job as a challenge. Our 14.4kW array was not cheap due to the concitions of the install but the care and attention to detail that went into the workmanship was great.Gerard and his team were always welll mannaered and cheerful, on time, tidy. The grid was connected without issue and data flowing into the Enphase app.I'd highly recommend Gedlec to anyone especially if other installers have previously passed on your property due to potential installation issues",
